tools/ and catalog/ are gitignored views

00:11:00.792 --> 00:11:02.727
assembled from the mounted packs

00:11:02.789 --> 00:11:06.785
«profiles-json»: the private brands/suse

00:11:06.849 --> 00:11:09.921
pack «skipped automatically on clone if

00:11:09.971 --> 00:11:12.582
you don't have access - it's update =

00:11:12.701 --> 00:11:16.295
none» plus the public community/ tools.

00:11:17.048 --> 00:11:19.999
Without SUSE access you land on the blank

00:11:20.067 --> 00:11:22.729
lolly-start brand and everything still

00:11:22.791 --> 00:11:24.645
builds and runs.

00:11:25.432 --> 00:11:27.594
Switch explicitly:

00:11:28.372 --> 00:11:31.193
Code example omitted.

00:11:31.981 --> 00:11:35.350
See docs/authoring-tools-md to build your

00:11:35.441 --> 00:11:38.528
first tool, and Development below for the

00:11:38.632 --> 00:11:40.545
submodule workflow.

00:11:41.323 --> 00:11:43.854
Writing a tool without cloning the

00:11:43.916 --> 00:11:45.244
platform?

00:11:46.016 --> 00:11:49.990
npm i -D @lolly-tools/core installs the

00:11:50.081 --> 00:11:54.298
tool-author SDK from npm: the HostV1

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:57.830
contract types, the manifest validator and

00:11:57.905 --> 00:12:00.796
a mock host for testing hooks headlessly

00:12:00.882 --> 00:12:04.669
«see packages/core/README-md».

00:12:05.436 --> 00:12:07.960
A new brand pack can be generated from

00:12:08.016 --> 00:12:12.513
design tokens with npm run ingest:brand

00:12:12.589 --> 00:12:17.544
«DTCG / Tokens Studio / Penpot exports».

00:12:18.683 --> 00:12:19.795
The CLI

00:12:20.765 --> 00:12:23.166
lolly runs any tool from the terminal

00:12:23.264 --> 00:12:25.823
through the same engine and the same

00:12:25.883 --> 00:12:29.488
render path as the web shell - it is URL

00:12:29.564 --> 00:12:32.461
mode under a different transport, so

00:12:32.526 --> 00:12:36.945
--url=x is the value the app reads from ?

00:12:37.755 --> 00:12:40.418
url=x.

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:43.859
That makes it the build-pipeline, CI and

00:12:43.921 --> 00:12:47.553
scripting surface: generate an OG card at

00:12:47.614 --> 00:12:52.366
build time, fan a CSV out into 400 badges,

00:12:52.432 --> 00:12:55.969
render-check the whole catalog as a gate.

00:12:56.747 --> 00:12:59.568
Code example omitted.

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:03.164
Every export carries Content Credentials

00:13:03.225 --> 00:13:06.269
by default, signed on-device.

00:13:07.038 --> 00:13:10.519
To sign as you - so a recipient who pins

00:13:10.581 --> 00:13:13.388
your root reads Verified with your address

00:13:13.478 --> 00:13:16.202
on it rather than an anonymous signer -

00:13:16.262 --> 00:13:19.095
point it at your own key and certificate

00:13:19.155 --> 00:13:20.245
chain:

00:13:21.022 --> 00:13:23.843
Code example omitted.

00:13:24.624 --> 00:13:28.302
Full command surface in docs/cli-md; the

00:13:28.392 --> 00:13:31.084
setup path from a clean machine to a

00:13:31.145 --> 00:13:34.059
working, trusted signing identity is

00:13:34.134 --> 00:13:36.769
docs/cli-signing-md.

00:13:37.897 --> 00:13:39.228
Development

00:13:40.138 --> 00:13:42.444
New contributor?

00:13:43.222 --> 00:13:45.971
Start at CONTRIBUTING-md - it routes you

00:13:46.058 --> 00:13:48.401
through the recursive clone, content

00:13:48.461 --> 00:13:53.065
profiles, the tools//catalog/ symlink-view

00:13:53.126 --> 00:13:56.127
trap, which repo owns which file and the

00:13:56.187 --> 00:13:59.245
commands to run before a PR.

00:14:00.013 --> 00:14:03.222
Auditors and anyone touching a parser or a

00:14:03.284 --> 00:14:05.194
crypto module should read

00:14:05.265 --> 00:14:07.688
docs/threat-model-md and

00:14:07.749 --> 00:14:10.594
docs/parser-inventory-md.

00:14:11.386 --> 00:14:14.858
Lolly is an umbrella repo composed of git

00:14:14.941 --> 00:14:18.119
submodules «see Repository layout».

00:14:18.877 --> 00:14:21.741
That changes two things: how you clone,

00:14:21.792 --> 00:14:24.520
and where each change is committed.

00:14:25.297 --> 00:14:27.617
Clone / update

00:14:28.597 --> 00:14:31.418
Code example omitted.

00:14:32.176 --> 00:14:34.799
Each submodule is checked out on its own

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:37.151
main, tracking its repo under

00:14:37.214 --> 00:14:40.819
github-com/lolly-tools/*.

00:14:41.592 --> 00:14:44.660
Where your changes go - the umbrella pins

00:14:44.756 --> 00:14:48.161
a specific commit of each submodule, so a

00:14:48.223 --> 00:14:51.100
change is committed to the repo that owns

00:14:51.159 --> 00:14:54.116
the file, then the umbrella records the

00:14:54.176 --> 00:14:55.645
new pointer.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:58.898
The full path-to-repo ownership table

00:14:58.968 --> 00:15:02.562
lives in CONTRIBUTING-md section 4, which

00:15:02.629 --> 00:15:05.994
is the single source of truth for it.

00:15:06.773 --> 00:15:09.935
⚠️ Committing from the umbrella root does

00:15:09.994 --> 00:15:13.254
not capture edits made inside a submodule

00:15:13.308 --> 00:15:16.070
- git only sees the pointer.

00:15:16.832 --> 00:15:20.198
Commit inside the submodule, or use loldev

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:21.419
«below».

00:15:22.186 --> 00:15:26.080
The tools/ and catalog/ views are symlinks

00:15:26.113 --> 00:15:28.989
into the packs, so editing through them

00:15:29.085 --> 00:15:31.350
flows to the right pack checkout

00:15:31.417 --> 00:15:32.969
automatically.

00:15:33.733 --> 00:15:36.650
Editing a SUSE tool touches two repos

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:39.922
«suse-lolly + umbrella pointer»; a

00:15:39.983 --> 00:15:42.664
community tool touches three «lolly-tools

00:15:42.726 --> 00:15:46.453
manifest, suse-lolly regenerated index,

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:48.320
umbrella pointer».

00:15:49.115 --> 00:15:52.919
loldev - one command to ship a change.

00:15:53.688 --> 00:15:56.549
A helper that does the multi-repo dance

00:15:56.649 --> 00:15:57.994
for you.

00:15:58.789 --> 00:16:01.718
Install it on your PATH:

00:16:02.497 --> 00:16:05.318
Code example omitted.

00:16:06.097 --> 00:16:08.918
Code example omitted.

00:16:09.718 --> 00:16:13.950
loldev operates on ~/Build/lolly by

00:16:14.004 --> 00:16:16.994
default «override with LOLLY_ROOT».

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:19.554
The underlying scripts live in

00:16:19.613 --> 00:16:24.390
scripts/subrepo/ - sync-sh, status-sh,

00:16:24.448 --> 00:16:28.881
verify-sh, plus migrate-sh/snap-history-sh

00:16:28.949 --> 00:16:30.845
«the one-time split».

00:16:31.973 --> 00:16:33.501
Current tools

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:36.990
The Lolly Start «blank brand» catalog

00:16:37.099 --> 00:16:40.405
ships 61 tools today - 60 listed in the

00:16:40.466 --> 00:16:43.648
gallery, plus one unlisted helper «Asset

00:16:43.716 --> 00:16:44.969
Export».

00:16:45.744 --> 00:16:50.238
Generated from catalog/tools/index-json by

00:16:50.321 --> 00:16:53.669
npm run build:readme-tools:

00:16:54.444 --> 00:16:57.716
The utility "Offline Utilities" section

00:16:57.818 --> 00:17:00.869
always renders last in the gallery.

00:17:02.028 --> 00:17:04.442
Licensing & structure

00:17:05.538 --> 00:17:08.668
Every unit now lives in its own repo under

00:17:08.732 --> 00:17:12.366
github-com/lolly-tools, pinned as a

00:17:12.486 --> 00:17:15.463
submodule of this umbrella «see Repository

00:17:15.524 --> 00:17:16.694
layout».

00:17:17.455 --> 00:17:21.975
Code - engine/, shells/, services/, docs/

00:17:22.008 --> 00:17:24.819
- is MPL-2 point 0.

00:17:25.597 --> 00:17:29.118
Tool content ships as brand packs.

00:17:29.884 --> 00:17:32.835
community/ «public lolly-tools» holds the

00:17:32.909 --> 00:17:36.866
brand-agnostic tools; brands/suse/

00:17:36.928 --> 00:17:39.883
«private suse-lolly» holds the SUSE tools

00:17:39.945 --> 00:17:42.944
and catalog - including its licensed

00:17:43.011 --> 00:17:45.899
PremiumBeat music, which stays private

00:17:45.955 --> 00:17:47.419
with the pack.

00:17:48.188 --> 00:17:51.931
The repo-root tools/ and catalog/ are

00:17:51.992 --> 00:17:54.471
gitignored profile views assembled from

00:17:54.531 --> 00:17:58.520
those packs; see each pack's NOTICE-md.

00:17:59.305 --> 00:18:01.823
Fonts ship inside each brand pack under

00:18:01.872 --> 00:18:05.800
the SIL Open Font License 1 point 1 - the

00:18:05.915 --> 00:18:09.006
SUSE pack carries the SUSE and SUSE Mono

00:18:09.069 --> 00:18:11.754
typefaces «neither the MPL nor

00:18:11.847 --> 00:18:15.233
SUSE-proprietary; "SUSE" is a SUSE

00:18:15.295 --> 00:18:16.644
trademark».

00:18:17.411 --> 00:18:21.092
They appear at catalog/fonts/ in a built

00:18:21.154 --> 00:18:22.819
profile view.

00:18:23.592 --> 00:18:26.288
Bundled third-party attributions are

00:18:26.350 --> 00:18:29.744
listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES-md.
